## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid Burst Pickoff (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Genius Wand, Wishing Lantern, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Genius Wand, Wishing Lantern, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Weapon Master, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Magic Boots over Arcane Boots when Use when lane is safe and more frequent Molina Smooch setups matter more than early flat Magic Penetration.; Glowing Wand over Wishing Lantern when Use when healing, shields, or HP-stacking frontliners keep surviving after the first transform combo.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when one assassin can reach Nana before Molina Smooch or Flicker creates enough space.
- Total cost: 12010 gold

Default ranked mid build that turns Molina Smooch's Magic Defense cut into a fast pickoff window before adding late Magic Power and shield value.

### Cooldown Zone Control (Mid)

- Items: Magic Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Lightning Truncheon, Glowing Wand, Fleeting Time, Divine Glaive
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Fleeting Time
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flameshot
- Flex: Holy Crystal over Fleeting Time when Use when your team needs higher burst per transform instead of ultimate reset tempo from assists.; Ice Queen Wand over Lightning Truncheon when Use when enemies keep walking out of Molina Blitz and your team needs extra slow control.; Blood Wings over Divine Glaive when Use when enemies are not stacking Magic Defense and Nana needs shielded movement between poke trades.
- Total cost: 11100 gold

Control setup for games where Nana wins by spamming Molina zones, collecting assists, and keeping objective entrances unsafe.

### Anti-Dive Survival (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive, Immortality
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Blood Wings over Immortality when Use when poke and chip damage are the problem but the enemy lacks the lockdown to force a death timer trade.; Magic Boots over Tough Boots when Use when enemy dive is damage-heavy but not control-heavy enough to justify Fortitude plus Purify.; Ice Queen Wand over Divine Glaive when Use when enemies have low Magic Defense but your team needs longer slows after Molina Smooch lands.
- Total cost: 10820 gold

Defensive mid build for hard engage games where Nana must survive the first lockout, keep Molina active, and still mark targets for allies.

